# AgentMemory Tool Routing

Gate: if AgentMemory is not connected/ready, skip all memory tools.

Prefer the smallest tool that answers the question. Default coding turns stay on
`agentmemory-recall` + `agentmemory-capture` tools only.

## Everyday (default rules already cover)

| Job | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Lessons before approach | `memory_lesson_recall` |
| Hybrid search + expand | `memory_smart_search` |
| Compact session hits | `memory_recall` (`format: compact`) |
| File-scoped past notes | `memory_file_history` |
| Recurring failure patterns | `memory_patterns` |
| Provenance check | `memory_verify` |
| Commit → sessions | `memory_commit_lookup` |
| Save reusable guidance | `memory_lesson_save` |
| Save typed durable fact | `memory_save` |

## Situational (pull when the job needs it)

| Job | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Recent agent-linked commits | `memory_commits` |
| Chronology around an event | `memory_timeline` |
| Related memories / graph | `memory_relations`, `memory_graph_query` |
| Synthesized insights list | `memory_insight_list` |
| Working notes / pinned state | `memory_slot_list` / `get` / `append` / `replace` / `create` / `delete` |
| Project concept/file profile | `memory_profile` (requires stable `project` id) |
| Facet filters | `memory_facet_query` / `memory_facet_tag` |
| Screenshot / image search | `memory_vision_search` |

Slots are size-limited editable units — compact aggressively; do not treat them
as a second chat log.

## Multi-agent / orchestration (only when coordinating work)

| Job | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Next / ranked work | `memory_next`, `memory_frontier` |
| Create / update work items | `memory_action_create`, `memory_action_update` |
| Exclusive claim | `memory_lease` |
| CI/approval gates | `memory_checkpoint` |
| Event-driven unblock | `memory_sentinel_create` / `memory_sentinel_trigger` |
| Exploratory action graph | `memory_sketch_create` / `memory_sketch_promote` |
| Agent messages | `memory_signal_send` / `memory_signal_read` |
| Peer sync | `memory_mesh_sync` |
| Team share / feed | `memory_team_share` / `memory_team_feed` |
| Freeze workflow run | `memory_routine_run` |
| Compress finished action chains | `memory_crystallize` |

Do not open an action graph for ordinary single-agent coding.

## Maintenance (user-asked or broken memory subsystem)

| Job | Tool |
| --- | --- |
| Health / auto-fix | `memory_diagnose`, `memory_heal` |
| Audit trail | `memory_audit` |
| Consolidation tiers | `memory_consolidate` |
| LLM cluster reflect | `memory_reflect` (expensive — rare) |
| Snapshot / export | `memory_snapshot_create`, `memory_export`, `memory_obsidian_export` |
| Claude MEMORY.md bridge | `memory_claude_bridge_sync` |
| Delete with audit | `memory_governance_delete` |
| Shrink a markdown file | `memory_compress_file` |

For playbooks, load skill `agentmemory-ops`.
